  "id": "ghakis_lair",
  "name": "Under Mount Ghakis",
  "region": "mount_ghakis",
  "summary": "The count's caves under the north shoulder of Mount Ghakis: the keepers' post, their larder, the anchor of a great chain, a gallery of fire-cracked rock and, at the bottom, the dragon chained on her hoard (The Warm Snow, docs/story/side_quests.md).",
  "text": "A tunnel into the mountain, warm as a kitchen and getting warmer. The rock sweats. Every so often the whole floor trembles, very slightly, in and out, like a sleeper's chest.",
